TODO.md: «Tighten these lyrics in the lyrics box, by the Writer's model; style suggestions as chips under the Style, made anew on demand (SUNO's ✦ and ↻ under its Styles)»; Viktor 11.10.2026: «Идеи из SUNO внедряй для релиза 2.0.0». window.HeresyWriterAsk: the Writer room's own choice (OpenRouter or the chat server), the request and its answer in the log, a model that spent its answer thinking asked once more. Tighten (beside the lyrics' .txt buttons): the model keeps every section tag, the meaning, the language and the rhymes; a window shows both texts side by side, the words counted, the tags the answer left out said; Ask again, Apply (as typed: Ctrl+Z in the box brings the old ones back) or Cancel. Suggest (under the Style): eight short tags the style has not got (the answer's lines, numbers and bullets off), as chips; a chip goes in before the style's BPM at its end; ↻ asks for others, naming those shown. Suite 680/0 (suite-1357.part); 20 strings in the six catalogs (batch_1357.py).

